# Write prompt for a 40-line file: the diff preview caps at
# maxEditPromptDiffRows=12 (permission_render.go), showing "… +28 more
# lines", while the question and the option rows stay on screen (that
# capping is exactly what keeps them visible — permission_render.go's
# doc comment on defect 1).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/permissions-write-40-lines.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE generate the 40-line file
KEY enter
WAITFOR /approval needed/ 20
SHOT write-prompt-capped
EXPECT /Allow kiln to write to .*lines\.ts\?/
EXPECT /line1 = 1;/
EXPECT /line12 = 12;/
EXPECT_NOT /line13 = 13;/
EXPECT /… \+28 more lines/
EXPECT /Yes/
EXPECT /No/
EXPECT /↑↓ select · enter confirm · esc decline · tab to amend/
KEY 1
WAITFOR /Wrote the 40-line file/ 20
SHOT write-applied
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
